  ($q$quotidien-societe$q$, $q$Quotidien & société$q$, $q$#f59e0b$q$, $q$from-[#1c1608] via-[#92400e] to-[#fbbf24]$q$),
  ($q$mots-origines$q$, $q$Mots & origines$q$, $q$#14b8a6$q$, $q$from-[#06221f] via-[#0f766e] to-[#5eead4]$q$),
